        "conclusion": "Accepted. The current table explicitly separates standing/crouch-still, crouch-moving, and uncrouched-moving/airborne. All 11 rows match the frozen four-state hip values and aim values in the counter addendum; in particular the three heavy-stubber hip crouch-moving thresholds are 1.5s versus 0.25s uncrouched-moving, and Lasgun Mk IIb is 0.5s versus 1.2s. Ground crouch movement and airborne mapping are represented without conflating the states.",
