          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/開啟齊射/SOURCE_INDEX.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Strict t > shooting_end_time + current clear-time is retained, with stopped shooting, num_shots > 0, and no dont_clear_num_shots action. A later check reads the current spread template and movement state; airborne maps to moving. Buff cache refresh precedes the weapon phase; the selected zero-count first shot consumes the pre-increment cache, then increments the shared count before _shoot, and later fixed updates recalculate. No universal fixed delay or direct reload/switch reset is claimed."
      },
