        "conclusion": "Accepted. Player text preserves Opening Salvo / 開啟齊射, describes a shot-count trigger rather than target-count, avoids ambiguous semi-automatic “single shot” phrasing, and distinguishes miss from empty-magazine dry fire. Normal and aimed direct hits use ranged Power; weapon bashes/flashlight toggles and Phosphor explosion/buff-type burn do not receive this ranged modifier. The S_native formula applies the power bonus after native power-type conversion and before downstream attack, impact, and cleave calculations; examples do not equate Power increase with final damage percentage. RAW name/description keys, locale strings, hashes, and formatter reconstruction remain separated."
